			],
			"Message": "feat(Wind): Forward extension host protocol messages to Mountain\n\nAdd ForwardToMountain function in Preload.ts to relay binary extension host protocol messages to Mountain for gRPC relay to Cocoon. Implements bidirectional messaging by listening for cocoon:extensionHostReply Tauri events and posting responses back to the workbench port.\n\nAdds performance.mark() calls for handshake-complete and message flow tracing. This completes the IPC bridge enabling VS Code extension host bidirectional communication with the workbench via Mountain.\n\nRefs: Vine protocol (Mountain ↔ Cocoon)",
